<title>HONG KONG: FPB Bank 1996 profit rises 37.4 percent.</title>
<headline>FPB Bank 1996 profit rises 37.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   32.7   vs  23.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    6.0    vs  5.1</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    350.64 vs  255.24</p>
<p>    Company name		 FPB Bank Holdings Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  March 17-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 19</p>
<p>NOTE - FPB Bank is the parent of First Pacific Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 10 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of four cents) vs 8.3 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
